(I'm playing Nethack Version 3.0i Patchlevel 9.)

There's a bug in Nethack that lets monsters throw items at you even
while you're invisible.  This bug's been around a long time - I know
that I reported it to the development team several years ago.  The fix
is pretty simple - the function lined_up in mthrowu needs to check to
see whether the monster can see you.  At any rate, I'm getting awful
tired of being pincushioned down corridors and when I'm invisible.
Shall I post a patch or is this going to fixed Real Soon Now?

					-- Scott Turner


